The OC4 reference jacket geometry in data/geometry/ is transcribed from NREL's
FAST CertTest distribution (NREL, US Department of Energy; Apache-2.0) and
describes the jacket defined in Vorpahl, Popko & Kaufer (2013) for IEA Wind
Task 30. It is included for research use with attribution; see
data/geometry/MANIFEST.json for the full provenance record.
